IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. TAX-SUD.

DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-TAXABLE   PIC S9(11)V99 COMP-3.
01 WS-PIT       PIC S9(9)V99 COMP-3.
01 WS-REMAINING PIC S9(11)V99 COMP-3.
01 WS-BRACKET   PIC S9(11)V99 COMP-3.
01 WS-PREV      PIC S9(9)V99 VALUE 50000.00.
01 WS-CUR       PIC S9(9)V99.
01 WS-RATE      PIC 9V99.
01 WS-PIT-DISP  PIC ZZZZZZZZ9.99.
01 IDX          PIC 9(02).
01 WS-LIMITS.
   05 FILLER PIC 9(9)V99 VALUE 100000.00.
   05 FILLER PIC 9(9)V99 VALUE 200000.00.
   05 FILLER PIC 9(9)V99 VALUE 400000.00.
   05 FILLER PIC 9(9)V99 VALUE 999999999.00.
01 WS-L REDEFINES WS-LIMITS.
   05 WS-LIMIT OCCURS 4 PIC 9(9)V99.
01 WS-RATES.
   05 FILLER PIC 9V99 VALUE 0.05.
   05 FILLER PIC 9V99 VALUE 0.10.
   05 FILLER PIC 9V99 VALUE 0.15.
   05 FILLER PIC 9V99 VALUE 0.20.
01 WS-R REDEFINES WS-RATES.
   05 WS-RATE-T OCCURS 4 PIC 9V99.

LINKAGE SECTION.
01 LS-TAXABLE-STR PIC X(15).
01 LS-PIT-STR     PIC X(15).

PROCEDURE DIVISION USING LS-TAXABLE-STR LS-PIT-STR.
    COMPUTE WS-TAXABLE = FUNCTION NUMVAL(LS-TAXABLE-STR)
    IF WS-TAXABLE <= 50000
        MOVE 0 TO WS-PIT
    ELSE
        COMPUTE WS-REMAINING = WS-TAXABLE - 50000
        MOVE 0 TO WS-PIT
        MOVE 50000 TO WS-PREV
        PERFORM VARYING IDX FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL IDX > 4
            MOVE WS-LIMIT(IDX) TO WS-CUR
            MOVE WS-RATE-T(IDX) TO WS-RATE
            COMPUTE WS-BRACKET = WS-CUR - WS-PREV
            IF WS-REMAINING <= 0 EXIT PERFORM END-IF
            IF WS-REMAINING > WS-BRACKET
                COMPUTE WS-PIT = WS-PIT + WS-BRACKET * WS-RATE
                COMPUTE WS-REMAINING = WS-REMAINING - WS-BRACKET
            ELSE
                COMPUTE WS-PIT = WS-PIT + WS-REMAINING * WS-RATE
                MOVE 0 TO WS-REMAINING
            END-IF
            MOVE WS-CUR TO WS-PREV
        END-PERFORM
        COMPUTE WS-PIT ROUNDED = WS-PIT
    END-IF
    MOVE WS-PIT TO WS-PIT-DISP
    MOVE FUNCTION TRIM(WS-PIT-DISP) TO LS-PIT-STR
    GOBACK.
